OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FFog may linger through the
OL,6,Fmorning and perhaps into the afternoon
OL,7,Facross central areas. Rain gradually
OL,8,Fspreads northeastwards through today,
OL,9,Ffeeling chilly across the south.
OL,10,FShowers reach northern Scotland later,
OL,11,Fwhile elsewhere remains dry with sunny
OL,12,Fspells. Temperatures near average.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FOutbreaks of rain affect much
OL,15,Fof southern England and Wales tonight,
OL,16,Fheavy at times. Further north, a few
OL,17,Fshowers along North Sea coasts,
OL,18,Fotherwise clear spells allow frost to
OL,19,Fdevelop.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
