OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FPatchy rain and drizzle
OL,6,Facross the south at first, becoming
OL,7,Fdrier with some brighter moments
OL,8,Fdeveloping before evening. Frequent
OL,9,Fblustery showers push into the
OL,10,Fnortheast through the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
